  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 3.9% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $2.40B (3.9% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/fabricated-rumors-about-bitmart-founder-binance-bstocks-dominate-asia-express?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\u2018Fabricated rumors\u2019 about BitMart founder, Binance bStocks dominate: Asia Express</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/markets/2026-08-18-securitize-neubergers-230-billion-fixed-income-platform-onchain-new-tokenized-fund-412102\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Securitize brings Neuberger\u2019s $230 billion fixed-income platform onchain with new tokenized fund</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/neuberger-launches-tokenized-fixed-income-fund-with-securitize?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Neuberger teams with Securitize on multi-chain tokenized fixed-income fund launch</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/08/18/r\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">U.S. SEC proposes first major crypto rule in surprise announcement</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
